## Production build variables

# Path this build is served from, used as both the asset base and the
# BrowserRouter basename. This is the Tomcat context path of the deployed WAR
# plus the package's dist folder. Override it in .env.production.local (which is
# gitignored) when your local context path differs.
#
# Links out to sibling apps such as the client are derived from this, so there is
# no second path to keep in sync.
VITE_BASE_URL=/SemossWeb/packages/playground/dist/
